              "text": "吵 — chǎo — \"noisy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "他的音乐太吵了 tā de yīnyuè tài chǎo le — His music is far too loud."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 吵 (chǎo) — 口 on the left and 少 on the right. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
